sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Orders
  participant DB as orders_db
  participant K as Kafka
  participant I as Inventory
  participant P as Payments
  participant F as Fulfillment
  C->>G: POST /v1/orders + Idempotency-Key
  G->>O: trusted actor context
  O->>DB: order + Saga + idempotency + Outbox transaction
  DB-->>O: committed
  O-->>G: 202 PENDING
  G-->>C: 202 PENDING
  O->>K: ReserveInventory command
  K->>I: command
  I->>K: InventoryReserved
  K->>O: fact + Inbox transaction
  O->>K: AuthorizePayment command
  K->>P: command
  P->>K: PaymentAuthorized
  K->>O: fact + confirm order
  O->>K: CreateShipment command
  K->>F: command
  F->>K: ShipmentCreated
  K->>O: fact + persist shipment reference
  F->>K: ShipmentCompleted
  K->>O: fact + complete order
